      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The reviewers' feedback suggests a potential issue with the statistical analysis in Zhang et al.'s research. The non-standard estimator approach in calculating the variance and p-value used for the control group, which is inappropriate for skewed biological data, could have inflated the significance of the results. This flaw in the methodology is serious enough that it might indeed preclude publication unless the authors can adequately justify and correct their statistical approach to reflect the biological sample distribution accurately. It would be advisable to request a revised manuscript from the authors focusing on revising their statistical methods to align with standard practices.",
